# Dawn-Blessed Pennant ({1}): "As this artifact enters, choose Elemental, Elf, Faerie, Giant, Goblin, Kithkin, Merfolk, or
# Treefolk" (CR 614.12a; Human is not offered), "Whenever a permanent you control of the chosen type enters, you gain 1
# life" and "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Return target card of the chosen type from your graveyard to your hand".
